      "writtenOn": "2017-06-14T22:30:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "get_time_dsw_pwrok should return -20 msec on Fizz because there is 20 msec lag between dsw_pwrok and the time EC\u0027s timer starts. Some boards may enable dsw_pwrok using a GPIO pin. Then the value should be positive. For Fizz, since DSW_PWROK is connected to EC\u0027s VCC1, the value is negative.\n\nShould I convert the return type to signed int? Then, we can support both cases.",
      "parentUuid": "b7c07c25_25ded37b",
      "revId": "df738741ff59fcce2bbbcb20969f4076efdb79ed",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
